stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Loading: refresh
  Loading --> Ready: list succeeds
  Loading --> Error: list fails
  Error --> Loading: retry
  Ready --> Loading: refresh or parent filter changes
  Ready --> Ready: close or reopen disclosure
  Loading --> Denied: session invalidated
  Ready --> Denied: session invalidated
  Error --> Denied: session invalidated
  Denied --> Denied: late response ignored
  Loading --> Disposed: dispose
  Ready --> Disposed: dispose
  Disposed --> Disposed: late response or refresh ignored
